#: ../xfce4-about/xfce4-about-dialog.glade.h:19
msgid ""
"Xfce is also a development platform providing several libraries that help programmers create applications that fit in well with the desktop environment.\n"
"\n"
"Xfce components are licensed under free or open source licences; GPL or BSDL for applications and LGPL or BSDL for libraries. Look at the documentation, the source code or the Xfce website (<a href=\"https://www.xfce.org\">https://www.xfce.org</a>) for more information.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your interest in Xfce.\n"
"\n"
"\t- The Xfce Development Team"
msgstr ""
"Xfce garapen-plataforma bat ere bada, eta mahaigain-ingurunearekin ondo uztartzen diren aplikazioak sortzen laguntzen dieten hainbat liburutegi eskaintzen die programatzaileei.\n"
"\n"
"Xfce-ren osagaiak software libreko edo kode irekiko lizentziekin banatzen dira: GPL edo BSDL aplikazioetarako, eta LGPL edo BSDL liburutegietarako. Informazio gehiagorako, kontsultatu dokumentazioa, iturburu-kodea edo Xfce-ren webgunea (<a href=\"https://www.xfce.org\">https://www.xfce.org</a>).\n"
"\n"
"Eskerrik asko Xfce-rekiko interesagatik.\n"
"\n"
"\t- Xfce garapen taldea"

